# agent-browser Skill

## Overview

A fast, native Rust-based browser automation CLI designed for AI agents. Provides command-line interface for browser control and web interactions.

## Installation

```bash
npm install -g agent-browser
```

## Core Capabilities

- Browser automation via CLI
- Web page navigation and interaction
- Screenshot capture
- JavaScript execution
- Element extraction and manipulation

## Usage

```bash
# Start a browsing session
agent-browser

# Navigate to a URL
agent-browser navigate <url>

# Take a screenshot
agent-browser screenshot

# Execute JavaScript
agent-browser eval <script>

# Extract elements
agent-browser extract <selector>
```

## Use Cases

- Web scraping and data extraction
- Automated testing
- AI-assisted web browsing
- Desktop application GUI control